@base = http://localhost:8080
@token = your-token-here
@noteId = 1
@jobId = 1
@taskId = 1

### 上传 UTF-8 文本：立即返回 noteId 和 jobId，后台生成向量与片段
POST {{base}}/notes/upload-async
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=DemoBoundary

--DemoBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="title"

演示学习资料
--DemoBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="example.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

< ./example.txt
--DemoBoundary--

### 查询后台任务状态
GET {{base}}/chunk-jobs/{{jobId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 失败后重试
POST {{base}}/chunk-jobs/{{jobId}}/retry
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 生成今日复习任务（先对一道题答错）
POST {{base}}/study/tasks/generate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 查看今日计划
GET {{base}}/study/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 标记任务完成
PUT {{base}}/study/tasks/{{taskId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"completed": true}

### 模型可按需选择笔记、错题与统计工具
POST {{base}}/study/assistant
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"message": "请查看我的答题统计，并给我一个简短复习建议。"}
